# NOTICE

omp-multi-pass is a fork of [pi-multi-pass](https://github.com/hjanuschka/pi-multi-pass)
by hjanuschka, used under the MIT License. See `LICENSE`.

It bundles [gemini-app2api / pi-gemini-app](https://github.com/ShawTim/gemini-app2api)
by ShawTim, [pi-clinepass-provider](https://github.com/jellydn/pi-clinepass-provider)
by jellydn, and [pi-commandcode-provider](https://github.com/safzanpirani/pi-commandcode-provider)
by safzanpirani, all used under the MIT License. The vendored copies live in
`vendor/` and keep their original `LICENSE` and (for gemini-app2api)
`DISCLAIMER.md`.

Changes in this fork:

- oh-my-pi (omp) extension hosting, configuration paths, and auth compatibility
  (`authStorage.hasAuth` crash fix).
- Gemini App provider wiring for multi-account subscriptions.
- Bundled Gemini App provider extension (native HTTP/2, `/login gemini-app`,
  `/gemini-quota`), adapted when the host omits newer pi-ai helpers.
- ClinePass provider bundled and exposed as multi-account subscriptions
  (`clinepass-1`, `clinepass-2`, ...), with WorkOS CLI credential reuse.
- ClinePass error handler also matches subscription provider ids.
- Command Code provider bundled as-is (`commandcode`); it is API-key only.

Upstream projects are not affiliated with this fork.
